  "formulas": [
    {
      "id": "calc.lim.important_sin",
      "name": "第一重要极限",
      "aliases": ["正弦比值极限"],
      "latex": "\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{\\sin x}{x} = 1",
      "statement": "当自变量 x（弧度制）趋近于 0 时，sin x 与 x 之比的极限为 1，是三角函数求导与等价无穷小替换的根基。",
      "taxonomy": {
        "disciplines": ["mathematics"],
        "education_stages": ["undergraduate"],
        "topics": ["limits_continuity"]
      },
      "variables": [
        { "symbol": "x", "name": "弧度角自变量", "math_type": "angle", "domain": "\\mathbb{R} \\setminus \\{0\\}", "quantity_kind": "plane_angle", "dimension": "1", "si_unit": "rad" }
      ],
      "conditions": ["x 必须采用弧度制；推广形式 lim_{u→0} (sin u)/u = 1"],
      "review": { "status": "human_verified", "source": "同济高等数学上册 1.6", "sympy_verified": true }
    },
    {
      "id": "calc.lim.important_e",
      "name": "第二重要极限（自然常数 e）",
      "aliases": ["连续复利极限"],
      "latex": "\\lim_{x \\to \\infty} \\left(1 + \\frac{1}{x}\\right)^x = e",
      "statement": "1^∞ 型未定式的核心基准极限，直接定义了自然对数底数 e ≈ 2.71828，并在连续复利与指数增长模型中广泛使用。",
      "taxonomy": {
        "disciplines": ["mathematics"],
        "education_stages": ["undergraduate"],
        "topics": ["limits_continuity"]
      },
      "variables": [
        { "symbol": "e", "name": "自然常数（欧拉数）", "math_type": "constant", "domain": "(2.718, 2.719)", "quantity_kind": null, "dimension": "1", "si_unit": "1" }
      ],
      "conditions": ["等价形式 lim_{t→0} (1 + t)^(1/t) = e"],
      "review": { "status": "human_verified", "source": "同济高等数学上册 1.6", "sympy_verified": true }
    },
    {
      "id": "calc.lim.equiv_infinitesimal",
      "name": "等价无穷小替换",
      "aliases": ["无穷小阶替换公式"],
      "latex": "\\sin x \\sim x,\\quad \\ln(1+x) \\sim x,\\quad e^x - 1 \\sim x\\quad (x \\to 0)",
      "statement": "当 x → 0 时，若干超越函数与一次项 x 之比极限为 1，在乘除因子中可直接替换以大幅简化极限计算。",
      "taxonomy": {
        "disciplines": ["mathematics"],
        "education_stages": ["undergraduate"],
        "topics": ["limits_continuity"]
      },
      "variables": [
        { "symbol": "x", "name": "无穷小量", "math_type": "scalar", "domain": "x \\to 0", "quantity_kind": null, "dimension": null, "si_unit": null }
      ],
      "conditions": ["仅保证在乘除因子中直接替换安全；加减项中替换需检查抵消后的高阶项"],
      "review": { "status": "human_verified", "source": "同济高等数学上册 1.7", "sympy_verified": true }
    },
    {
      "id": "calc.lim.lhopital",
      "name": "洛必达法则（L'Hôpital）",
      "aliases": ["未定式求导极限法则"],
      "latex": "\\lim_{x \\to a} \\frac{f(x)}{g(x)} = \\lim_{x \\to a} \\frac{f'(x)}{g'(x)}",
      "statement": "处理 0/0 或 ∞/∞ 型未定式时，若分子分母导数之比的极限存在（或为无穷大），则原极限与之相等。",
      "taxonomy": {
        "disciplines": ["mathematics"],
        "education_stages": ["undergraduate"],
        "topics": ["limits_continuity"]
      },
      "variables": [
        { "symbol": "f, g", "name": "去心邻域可导函数", "math_type": "function", "domain": "U^\\circ(a)", "quantity_kind": null, "dimension": null, "si_unit": null }
      ],
      "conditions": ["必须是 0/0 或 ∞/∞ 型；去心邻域内 g'(x) ≠ 0；右端极限存在（或为 ∞）"],
      "review": { "status": "human_verified", "source": "同济高等数学上册 3.2", "sympy_verified": true }
    },
    {
      "id": "calc.diff.differential",
      "name": "微分定义与线性主部",
      "aliases": ["一阶微分公式"],
      "latex": "dy = f'(x)\\,dx,\\quad \\Delta y = f'(x)\\Delta x + o(\\Delta x)",
      "statement": "可微函数增量 Δy 的线性主部称为微分 dy，用切线增量局部逼近曲线增量，并满足一阶微分形式不变性。",
      "taxonomy": {
        "disciplines": ["mathematics"],
        "education_stages": ["undergraduate"],
        "topics": ["mean_value_taylor"]
      },
      "variables": [
        { "symbol": "dy, dx", "name": "因变量与自变量微分", "math_type": "scalar", "domain": "\\mathbb{R}", "quantity_kind": null, "dimension": null, "si_unit": null }
      ],
      "conditions": ["一元函数中可微与可导完全等价"],
      "review": { "status": "human_verified", "source": "同济高等数学上册 2.5", "sympy_verified": true }
    },
    {
      "id": "calc.diff.rolle",
      "name": "罗尔中值定理",
      "aliases": ["Rolle 定理"],
      "latex": "f(a) = f(b) \\implies \\exists\\ \\xi \\in (a, b),\\ f'(\\xi) = 0",
      "statement": "闭区间连续、开区间可导且两端点函数值相等的曲线，区间内部至少存在一点的切线水平。",
      "taxonomy": {
        "disciplines": ["mathematics"],
        "education_stages": ["undergraduate"],
        "topics": ["mean_value_taylor"]
      },
      "variables": [
        { "symbol": "\\xi", "name": "区间内驻点", "math_type": "scalar", "domain": "(a, b)", "quantity_kind": null, "dimension": null, "si_unit": null }
      ],
      "conditions": ["f 在 [a, b] 连续、在 (a, b) 可导，且 f(a) = f(b)"],
      "review": { "status": "human_verified", "source": "同济高等数学上册 3.1", "sympy_verified": true }
    },
    {
      "id": "calc.diff.lagrange",
      "name": "拉格朗日中值定理",
      "aliases": ["微分中值定理（MVT）"],
      "latex": "f(b) - f(a) = f'(\\xi)(b - a),\\quad \\xi \\in (a, b)",
      "statement": "光滑曲线上连接端点的割线斜率，必然等于区间内部至少某一点处的切线斜率，是连接局部导数与整体增量的核心桥梁。",
      "taxonomy": {
        "disciplines": ["mathematics"],
        "education_stages": ["undergraduate"],
        "topics": ["mean_value_taylor"]
      },
      "variables": [
        { "symbol": "\\xi", "name": "中值点", "math_type": "scalar", "domain": "(a, b)", "quantity_kind": null, "dimension": null, "si_unit": null }
      ],
      "conditions": ["f 在 [a, b] 连续、在 (a, b) 可导"],
      "review": { "status": "human_verified", "source": "同济高等数学上册 3.1", "sympy_verified": true }
    },
    {
      "id": "calc.diff.cauchy",
      "name": "柯西中值定理",
      "aliases": ["参数方程中值定理"],
      "latex": "\\frac{f(b) - f(a)}{g(b) - g(a)} = \\frac{f'(\\xi)}{g'(\\xi)},\\quad \\xi \\in (a, b)",
      "statement": "将拉格朗日中值定理推广到两个函数之比，几何上对应参数曲线的切线与弦平行，是洛必达法则的直接理论依据。",
      "taxonomy": {
        "disciplines": ["mathematics"],
        "education_stages": ["undergraduate"],
        "topics": ["mean_value_taylor"]
      },
      "variables": [
        { "symbol": "f, g", "name": "闭区间连续、开区间可导函数", "math_type": "function", "domain": "[a, b]", "quantity_kind": null, "dimension": null, "si_unit": null }
      ],
      "conditions": ["f, g 在 [a, b] 连续、(a, b) 可导，且对任意 x ∈ (a, b) 有 g'(x) ≠ 0"],
      "review": { "status": "human_verified", "source": "同济高等数学上册 3.1", "sympy_verified": true }
    },
    {
      "id": "calc.series.taylor",
      "name": "泰勒公式（带拉格朗日余项）",
      "aliases": ["泰勒展开式"],
      "latex": "f(x) = \\sum_{k=0}^{n} \\frac{f^{(k)}(x_0)}{k!}(x - x_0)^k + \\frac{f^{(n+1)}(\\xi)}{(n+1)!}(x - x_0)^{n+1}",
      "statement": "用 n 次多项式在 x0 邻域内高精度逼近任意 n+1 阶可导函数，并给出精确的截断误差余项表达。",
      "taxonomy": {
        "disciplines": ["mathematics"],
        "education_stages": ["undergraduate"],
        "topics": ["mean_value_taylor"]
      },
      "variables": [
        { "symbol": "x_0", "name": "展开中心点", "math_type": "constant", "domain": "\\mathbb{R}", "quantity_kind": null, "dimension": null, "si_unit": null },
        { "symbol": "\\xi", "name": "介于 x0 与 x 之间的中值点", "math_type": "scalar", "domain": "(x_0, x)", "quantity_kind": null, "dimension": null, "si_unit": null }
      ],
      "conditions": ["f 在包含 x0 的区间内具有 n+1 阶导数"],
      "review": { "status": "human_verified", "source": "同济高等数学上册 3.3", "sympy_verified": true }
    },
    {
      "id": "calc.series.maclaurin_exp",
      "name": "常用麦克劳林级数展开",
      "aliases": ["零点泰勒展开（e^x, sin x, cos x）"],
      "latex": "e^x = \\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty} \\frac{x^k}{k!},\\quad \\sin x = x - \\frac{x^3}{3!} + \\cdots",
      "statement": "在 x0 = 0 处展开基本初等函数为幂级数，是数值计算、高阶极限求值及欧拉公式推导的利器。",
      "taxonomy": {
        "disciplines": ["mathematics"],
        "education_stages": ["undergraduate"],
        "topics": ["mean_value_taylor"]
      },
      "variables": [
        { "symbol": "x", "name": "自变量", "math_type": "scalar", "domain": "\\mathbb{R}", "quantity_kind": null, "dimension": null, "si_unit": null }
      ],
      "conditions": ["e^x、sin x、cos x 的麦克劳林级数在整个实数轴 R 上均收敛"],
      "review": { "status": "human_verified", "source": "同济高等数学下册 12.4", "sympy_verified": true }
    },
    {
      "id": "calc.int.antiderivative",
      "name": "不定积分与原函数定义",
      "aliases": ["反导数定义式"],
      "latex": "\\int f(x)\\,dx = F(x) + C \\iff F'(x) = f(x)",
      "statement": "若 F'(x) = f(x)，则 F(x) + C 表示 f(x) 的全体原函数族，构成微分运算的逆运算。",
      "taxonomy": {
        "disciplines": ["mathematics"],
        "education_stages": ["undergraduate"],
        "topics": ["integral_calculus"]
      },
      "variables": [
        { "symbol": "F(x)", "name": "被积函数的一个原函数", "math_type": "function", "domain": "I", "quantity_kind": null, "dimension": null, "si_unit": null },
        { "symbol": "C", "name": "任意积分常数", "math_type": "constant", "domain": "\\mathbb{R}", "quantity_kind": null, "dimension": null, "si_unit": null }
      ],
      "conditions": ["f(x) 在区间 I 上连续时必存在原函数"],
      "review": { "status": "human_verified", "source": "同济高等数学上册 4.1", "sympy_verified": true }
    },
    {
      "id": "calc.int.riemann",
      "name": "定积分的黎曼和定义",
      "aliases": ["曲边梯形面积极限"],
      "latex": "\\int_a^b f(x)\\,dx = \\lim_{\\lambda \\to 0} \\sum_{i=1}^{n} f(\\xi_i)\\Delta x_i",
      "statement": "将区间 [a, b] 无限细分并对每个小区间上的矩形面积求和取极限，刻画连续变化量的累积总和。",
      "taxonomy": {
        "disciplines": ["mathematics"],
        "education_stages": ["undergraduate"],
        "topics": ["integral_calculus"]
      },
      "variables": [
        { "symbol": "\\lambda", "name": "最大小区间长度（网细度）", "math_type": "scalar", "domain": "(0, +\\infty)", "quantity_kind": null, "dimension": null, "si_unit": null },
        { "symbol": "\\Delta x_i", "name": "第 i 个小区间宽度", "math_type": "scalar", "domain": "(0, b-a]", "quantity_kind": null, "dimension": null, "si_unit": null }
      ],
      "conditions": ["极限值与分法及取点 ξi 无关；闭区间连续函数必黎曼可积"],
      "review": { "status": "human_verified", "source": "同济高等数学上册 5.1", "sympy_verified": true }
    },
    {
      "id": "calc.int.var_upper_limit",
      "name": "变上限积分求导公式",
      "aliases": ["微积分基本定理第一部分"],
      "latex": "\\frac{d}{dx} \\int_a^x f(t)\\,dt = f(x)",
      "statement": "连续函数的变上限积分本身就是被积函数的一个原函数，首次在理论上证明了积分与求导互为逆运算。",
      "taxonomy": {
        "disciplines": ["mathematics"],
        "education_stages": ["undergraduate"],
        "topics": ["integral_calculus"]
      },
      "variables": [
        { "symbol": "x", "name": "积分上限变量", "math_type": "scalar", "domain": "[a, b]", "quantity_kind": null, "dimension": null, "si_unit": null }
      ],
      "conditions": ["f(t) 在 [a, b] 上连续"],
      "review": { "status": "human_verified", "source": "同济高等数学上册 5.2", "sympy_verified": true }
    },
    {
      "id": "calc.int.newton_leibniz",
      "name": "牛顿-莱布尼茨公式",
      "aliases": ["微积分基本定理（FTC）"],
      "latex": "\\int_a^b f(x)\\,dx = F(b) - F(a)",
      "statement": "连续函数在 [a, b] 上的定积分等于其任意一个原函数在上下限处的差值，把复杂的无限求和化为简单的端点相减。",
      "taxonomy": {
        "disciplines": ["mathematics"],
        "education_stages": ["undergraduate"],
        "topics": ["integral_calculus"]
      },
      "variables": [
        { "symbol": "a, b", "name": "积分下限与上限", "math_type": "constant", "domain": "\\mathbb{R}", "quantity_kind": null, "dimension": null, "si_unit": null }
      ],
      "conditions": ["f(x) 在 [a, b] 连续且 F'(x) = f(x)"],
      "review": { "status": "human_verified", "source": "同济高等数学上册 5.2", "sympy_verified": true }
    },
    {
      "id": "calc.int.substitution",
      "name": "换元积分法",
      "aliases": ["凑微分法 / 变量代换积分"],
      "latex": "\\int f(\\varphi(t))\\varphi'(t)\\,dt = \\int f(u)\\,du\\quad (u = \\varphi(t))",
      "statement": "作为复合函数链式求导法则的逆运算，通过引入中间变量 u = φ(t) 将复杂被积式化归为基本积分表形式。",
      "taxonomy": {
        "disciplines": ["mathematics"],
        "education_stages": ["undergraduate"],
        "topics": ["integral_calculus"]
      },
      "variables": [
        { "symbol": "u = \\varphi(t)", "name": "可微替换函数", "math_type": "function", "domain": "\\mathbb{R}", "quantity_kind": null, "dimension": null, "si_unit": null }
      ],
      "conditions": ["定积分换元时必须同步变换积分上下限（换元必换限）"],
      "review": { "status": "human_verified", "source": "同济高等数学上册 4.2", "sympy_verified": true }
    },
    {
      "id": "calc.int.by_parts",
      "name": "分部积分法",
      "aliases": ["乘积求导逆法则"],
      "latex": "\\int u\\,dv = u v - \\int v\\,du",
      "statement": "作为乘积求导法则的逆运算，通过交换微分对象把难求的积分转移为更易求的积分，常遵循“反对幂指三”选 u 原则。",
      "taxonomy": {
        "disciplines": ["mathematics"],
        "education_stages": ["undergraduate"],
        "topics": ["integral_calculus"]
      },
      "variables": [
        { "symbol": "u, v", "name": "具有连续导数的函数", "math_type": "function", "domain": "I", "quantity_kind": null, "dimension": null, "si_unit": null }
      ],
      "conditions": ["u(x)、v(x) 在区间内具有连续导数"],
      "review": { "status": "human_verified", "source": "同济高等数学上册 4.3", "sympy_verified": true }
    },
    {
      "id": "calc.int.improper",
      "name": "无穷区间广义积分（反常积分）",
      "aliases": ["无穷限反常积分"],
      "latex": "\\int_a^{+\\infty} f(x)\\,dx = \\lim_{t \\to +\\infty} \\int_a^t f(x)\\,dx",
      "statement": "把定积分的有限区间通过取上限极限推广到无穷区间，是连续型概率密度归一性与拉普拉斯变换的计算基础。",
      "taxonomy": {
        "disciplines": ["mathematics"],
        "education_stages": ["undergraduate"],
        "topics": ["integral_calculus"]
      },
      "variables": [
        { "symbol": "t", "name": "趋于无穷的截断上限", "math_type": "scalar", "domain": "[a, +\\infty)", "quantity_kind": null, "dimension": null, "si_unit": null }
      ],
      "conditions": ["当且仅当右端极限有限存在时称该广义积分收敛"],
      "review": { "status": "human_verified", "source": "同济高等数学上册 5.4", "sympy_verified": true }
    },
    {
      "id": "calc.multi.partial_deriv",
      "name": "偏导数定义式",
      "aliases": ["多元函数偏导数"],
      "latex": "\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x}(x_0, y_0) = \\lim_{\\Delta x \\to 0} \\frac{f(x_0 + \\Delta x, y_0) - f(x_0, y_0)}{\\Delta x}",
      "statement": "固定其他自变量不变，仅让某一自变量变化所求得的变化率，几何上表示曲面沿坐标轴方向截线的切线斜率。",
